1
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:45,120
Looks like Chen Hai was prepared for this.

2
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:50,640
Contact the Shanxi police.

3
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,560
Have them visit Hu Dong's hometown.

4
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:55,159
See if Hu Dong really went back there.

5
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,319
I'll get right on it.

6
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:00,840
Captain Lu.

7
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,439
Ask him about the drugs.

8
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,280
Do you know Qian Feng?

9
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,000
Yes.

10
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,960
We've even had meals together.

11
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:11,560
Though we're not very close.

12
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:13,560
Not close?

13
00:02:16,159 --> 00:02:17,000
You worked together.

14
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,039
You must be mistaken.

15
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,280
Qian Feng doesn't even work for Longze.

16
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:27,680
Qian Feng is suspected of drug trafficking,

17
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,639
and we've already arrested him.

18
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:30,000
According to his confession,

19
00:02:30,759 --> 00:02:31,800
you are his supplier.

20
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,759
What drug trafficking?

21
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,879
What supplier?

22
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:38,639
I have no idea what you're talking about.

23
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,319
You don't understand, huh?

24
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,680
Then let me say it again.

25
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:44,520
Qian Feng trafficked drugs through Zhongtian Logistics,

26
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:45,840
and according to his statement,

27
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:48,199
you arranged all of it for him.

28
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:56,000
Are you sure Qian Feng was talking about me?

29
00:02:56,199 --> 00:02:57,439
I've already made it very clear to you.

30
00:02:57,439 --> 00:02:59,240
I barely even know the guy.

31
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,520
I've never even seen drugs in my life.

32
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,560
How could I traffic drugs?

33
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:09,719
Could he have been coerced into confessing

34
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,719
and just framed someone at random?

35
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:16,919
Mr. Chen.

36
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:18,879
Mind your words.

37
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,960
What era do you think this is?

38
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,400
We handle cases following legal procedures

39
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,159
and lawful methods.

40
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,039
From the moment you walked in,

41
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,080
have we coerced a confession out of you?

42
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,560
No, no, no.

43
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,520
That's not what I meant.

44
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:31,439
Some people...

45
00:03:31,439 --> 00:03:33,360
their mental resilience is rather weak.

46
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,639
Maybe your tone during interrogation

47
00:03:35,759 --> 00:03:36,759
was slightly too harsh,

48
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,919
so he just dragged others down with him.

49
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,000
Well,

50
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,599
about Qian Feng's arrest,

51
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,560
I did hear about it.

52
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:52,360
It's been quite a while now, hasn't it?

53
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,199
If you really had any evidence,

54
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:57,919
you wouldn't have waited until today to question me.

55
00:03:59,479 --> 00:04:01,800
Ask him about Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying.

56
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,159
Do you know Zhang Xuebin from Chaoqing,

57
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,400
and Guo Yingying from Yike Gifts?

58
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:13,960
Officers,

59
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,560
I think you really should

60
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,240
talk to my friends and family.

61
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,480
My life is very simple,

62
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,000
and so is my social circle.

63
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,560
Most days, if I'm not at home,

64
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,680
I'm at the office.

65
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,680
Now you suddenly rattle off these names,

66
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:30,000
asking if I know them or how close we are.

67
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:33,519
Can you just tell me,

68
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:38,319
what exactly do you suspect me of?

69
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:45,279
Zhang Xuebin, Guo Yingying, and Qian Feng

70
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:47,240
trafficked drugs via Zhongtian Logistics.

71
00:04:48,839 --> 00:04:50,199
After getting the drugs,

72
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:51,480
they passed them to their downlines.

73
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,879
And the one collecting the drug money

74
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:57,279
was the head of security at Longze Group:

75
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,000
Hu Dong.

76
00:04:59,439 --> 00:05:02,279
You and Hu Dong are colleagues at Longze,

77
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,079
and you interact frequently.

78
00:05:04,199 --> 00:05:05,600
And Zhou Fuhai from Zhongtian Logistics

79
00:05:06,079 --> 00:05:07,319
is your old classmate.

80
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:12,560
Don't you think this is too coincidental?

81
00:05:16,079 --> 00:05:17,959
So that's why you're looking for Hu Dong.

82
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,920
I already made this clear earlier:

83
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:22,879
Hu Dong and I aren't close.

84
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:25,199
As for interacting frequently,

85
00:05:25,639 --> 00:05:27,639
I have no idea what you're talking about.

86
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:32,279
I met Zhou Fuhai in business school.

87
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:33,279
Sure, we were classmates,

88
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:38,279
but that's as far as it goes.

89
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:42,759
As for Zhang Xuebin and this Guo Yingying,

90
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,040
whatever connection they have to me,

91
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:46,800
why don't you just ask them directly?

92
00:05:46,839 --> 00:05:47,920
They're both dead.

93
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:49,439
Dead?

94
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:52,480
How did they die?

95
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,720
You don't suspect me, do you?

96
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,079
We believe you probably weren't

97
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:09,680
the one who directly murdered them.

98
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,920
What's that supposed to mean?

99
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,800
Are you calling me the mastermind?

100
00:06:18,639 --> 00:06:19,600
Do you have any evidence?

101
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,199
Ever since I walked in here,

102
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,759
you've been falsely accusing me.

103
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,160
If you have evidence,

104
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,759
you can arrest me right now.

105
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,279
If you don't,

106
00:06:30,399 --> 00:06:32,319
I demand to leave immediately.

107
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,160
Mr. Chen,

108
00:06:34,639 --> 00:06:36,279
no one here is falsely accusing you.

109
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,439
However, we have the authority

110
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,439
to hold you in detention for 48 hours.

111
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,120
Right.

112
00:06:42,079 --> 00:06:43,319
You have the authority,

113
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:45,439
but I also have the right to stay silent.

114
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,439
From now on,

115
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:59,680
I refuse to answer any of your questions.

116
00:06:59,959 --> 00:07:00,680
I'll say it again:

117
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,000
if you have evidence, arrest me.

118
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:09,600
Fine.

119
00:07:11,839 --> 00:07:13,079
You're entitled to your rights.

120
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:16,360
But let me tell you this:

121
00:07:17,199 --> 00:07:19,720
our people are bringing Zhou Fuhai back.

122
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,279
Whatever deals you two had,

123
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,120
we'll find out soon enough.

124
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:25,319
Let's go.

125
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:28,959
Sorry for the trouble, gentlemen.

126
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:15,800
What do you think?

127
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,199
Judging by what he said,

128
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:20,959
he seems pretty confident.

129
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:24,120
He's very slick.

130
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,360
He knows very well

131
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,319
we have no direct evidence to arrest him.

132
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,360
He's smart,

133
00:08:31,839 --> 00:08:35,720
keeping the cash and goods separate.

134
00:08:36,639 --> 00:08:38,200
And on the receiving end,

135
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:41,159
neither the statements nor the evidence

136
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,200
are sufficient.

137
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:46,399
To prove Chen Hai trafficked drugs,

138
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:48,600
we can only start with Cheng Weimin

139
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:50,320
or Zhou Fuhai.

140
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,200
Jiangyang police have already picked up

141
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,080
Cheng Weimin's trail.

142
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,960
Once his exact whereabouts are confirmed,

143
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,039
they'll arrest him immediately.

144
00:08:57,639 --> 00:08:58,720
As for Zhongtian Logistics,

145
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:01,080
they let Qian Feng's cargo pass unchecked.

146
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,000
There's no way Zhou Fuhai knows nothing.

147
00:09:06,519 --> 00:09:07,960
When it comes to Zhongtian Logistics,

148
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,120
Li Xiao knows it best.

149
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,120
Go with him

150
00:09:10,919 --> 00:09:11,960
and bring Zhou Fuhai in.

151
00:09:12,399 --> 00:09:12,759
Yes, sir.

152
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,399
Hello.

153
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,080
Are you looking for Director Zhou?

154
00:10:09,399 --> 00:10:09,720
Yes.

155
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,120
We're from the Municipal Bureau.

156
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,000
We need to speak with Zhou Fuhai.

157
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:13,720
Where is he?

158
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:14,919
Unfortunately,

159
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,200
he didn't come in to work today.

160
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:17,279
He didn't come in?

161
00:10:18,039 --> 00:10:18,840
Did he say why?

162
00:10:19,559 --> 00:10:20,399
No, he didn't.

163
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,080
This morning,

164
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,360
during an important company meeting,

165
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,679
I called him, but he didn't pick up.

166
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,080
All right. Thank you.

167
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:30,480
You're welcome. Just doing my job.

168
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:40,480
Chen Hai was acting far too composed today.

169
00:10:41,279 --> 00:10:42,759
Something's likely happened to Zhou Fuhai.

170
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:08,759
Look at this.

171
00:11:09,039 --> 00:11:11,639
Look, water has soaked through our ceiling.

172
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,559
Last night when the water was shut off,

173
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,879
they must've left the tap running.

174
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,240
I went up and knocked forever,

175
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:17,200
but nobody answered.

176
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,960
Let's go check. Let's go take a look.

177
00:11:26,399 --> 00:11:27,039
There's so much water!

178
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:34,879
Someone's dead! He's dead!

179
00:11:34,879 --> 00:11:36,279
Call the police! Hurry, call the police!

180
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,279
We're from the Municipal Bureau.

181
00:11:37,559 --> 00:11:38,720
Officers, someone's dead!

182
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,879
He hanged himself!

183
00:11:42,039 --> 00:11:42,720
Clear the scene.

184
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:44,600
Notify the medical examiner.

185
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:45,600
Evacuate immediately.

186
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,679
Hurry, hurry! Move, move, move!

187
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,799
When was the last time

188
00:11:48,799 --> 00:11:49,480
you met with Hu Dong?

189
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,639
I've already told you.

190
00:11:53,639 --> 00:11:55,519
I'm not answering any more questions.

191
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,320
Captain Bai,

192
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:11,799
Zhou Fuhai is dead.

193
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:31,720
Excuse me, please make way.

194
00:12:33,679 --> 00:12:34,720
Captain Bai, please follow me.

195
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,200
Captain Bai.

196
00:12:49,919 --> 00:12:50,399
Captain Bai.

197
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:12,480
What's the situation?

198
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:15,840
Suicide by hanging.

199
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,759
Could this be another cover-up?

200
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,799
Judging from the scene,

201
00:13:24,039 --> 00:13:24,960
it really does look like suicide.

202
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:27,240
The ligature mark on the neck

203
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,600
is the direct cause of death.

204
00:13:29,519 --> 00:13:30,559
The facial cyanosis

205
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,639
was caused by jugular vein compression.

206
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:35,279
Hyoid bone fracture, tongue protruding,

207
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:36,679
all clear signs of hanging.

208
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,399
Still, a definitive conclusion

209
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:40,159
will require a full autopsy.

210
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:46,120
This voice recorder was found at the scene.

211
00:13:46,759 --> 00:13:48,480
He probably left it before he died.

212
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:54,759
What's with all the water in the room?

213
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,279
The water was shut off here last night.

214
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:59,120
The deceased left his tap open.

215
00:13:59,399 --> 00:14:01,000
When water was restored this morning,

216
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,679
it flooded outside and a neighbor noticed.

217
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:03,960
They went to property management,

218
00:14:04,159 --> 00:14:05,879
who happened to have a spare key.

219
00:14:06,039 --> 00:14:07,039
When they opened the door,

220
00:14:07,879 --> 00:14:08,799
they found the body.

221
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:10,759
Where's his family?

222
00:14:11,639 --> 00:14:12,840
He and his wife are separated.

223
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,320
His wife has the kid.

224
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:16,200
Captain,

225
00:14:16,879 --> 00:14:17,440
we've got something.

226
00:14:32,279 --> 00:14:33,039
Suicide to escape punishment.

227
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,799
What I am about to say

228
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,240
is my personal confession.

229
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:43,879
In everyone's eyes,

230
00:14:45,039 --> 00:14:47,240
I'm an executive at Zhongtian Logistics,

231
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,759
with a happy family.

232
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:53,080
But what no one knows

233
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:56,360
is that beneath an ordinary man's mask

234
00:14:56,919 --> 00:14:59,039
lies the identity of a criminal.

235
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:02,240
Two years ago,

236
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,559
I met drug dealer Cheng Weimin.

237
00:15:06,039 --> 00:15:06,960
He told me

238
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,799
drug trafficking was fast money.

239
00:15:10,279 --> 00:15:12,200
Blinded by greed,

240
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:15,200
I used my position at Zhongtian

241
00:15:15,679 --> 00:15:16,879
to traffic drugs with him.

242
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:22,080
In Nanhai, I found Qian Feng, Zhang Xuebin

243
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,519
and Guo Yingying as downlines.

244
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:28,159
Cheng Weimin used Zhongtian Logistics

245
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:31,240
to ship drugs to Qian Feng and the others.

246
00:15:32,679 --> 00:15:34,559
Although I made a lot of money,

247
00:15:35,039 --> 00:15:38,200
my mind was never at peace.

248
00:15:39,279 --> 00:15:43,039
Since the police investigated Zhongtian,

249
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,240
I realized

250
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:48,240
that I've reached the end of the road.

251
00:15:49,279 --> 00:15:50,240
During this time,

252
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:53,080
my conscience has been deeply tormented.

253
00:15:55,039 --> 00:15:56,519
I have failed my family

254
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,360
and the leaders who trusted me.

255
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:01,600
The wrongs I have done

256
00:16:02,679 --> 00:16:04,279
can no longer be undone.

257
00:16:05,759 --> 00:16:07,600
I can only use my death

258
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,320
to atone for my crimes.

259
00:16:17,559 --> 00:16:19,039
This recording from Zhou Fuhai

260
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:22,480
highly contradicts Qian Feng's confession.

261
00:16:24,919 --> 00:16:26,200
Yet judging by common sense,

262
00:16:26,879 --> 00:16:29,399
what's said in this recording seems genuine.

263
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,919
After all, these are words spoken

264
00:16:32,279 --> 00:16:33,559
by a man on the verge of death.

265
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:36,519
Could Chen Hai have merely connected

266
00:16:36,519 --> 00:16:37,840
Zhou Fuhai with Qian Feng,

267
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:39,200
without being involved in the drug trade?

268
00:16:40,039 --> 00:16:40,960
I still believe

269
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,320
Qian Feng's confession holds up.

270
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:46,240
Ever since Operation Thunderbolt began,

271
00:16:46,879 --> 00:16:49,000
all our leads have centered on Chen Hai.

272
00:16:49,679 --> 00:16:52,279
Yet Zhou Fuhai's statement claims

273
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:55,480
that the drug trafficking network

274
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:56,559
was built solely by him and Cheng Weimin.

275
00:16:57,159 --> 00:16:59,279
Could the highway arson case,

276
00:16:59,519 --> 00:17:00,799
the Qin Hao drug trafficking case,

277
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,879
and the Mu Qing drug trafficking case

278
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:05,279
really have nothing to do

279
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:07,039
with Zhongtian Logistics?

280
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:10,440
That's why I think

281
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,480
this recording,

282
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:14,160
even if recorded by Zhou Fuhai himself,

283
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:17,079
might still be concealing some truth.

284
00:17:18,559 --> 00:17:20,400
Yet in this recording,

285
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:24,440
Zhou explained his ties to Cheng and Qian

286
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:26,000
with total clarity,

287
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,119
and it all makes sense.

288
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,400
Since it's a confession,

289
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:32,079
he has no reason to omit only Chen Hai.

290
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:38,079
Our previous suspicions of Chen Hai

291
00:17:38,079 --> 00:17:39,160
were merely speculation.

292
00:17:39,519 --> 00:17:40,960
What we have before us now

293
00:17:41,039 --> 00:17:44,000
is a suspect's dying statement.

294
00:17:47,079 --> 00:17:48,359
Don't you think this recording

295
00:17:48,359 --> 00:17:49,599
sounds a bit off?

296
00:17:50,079 --> 00:17:51,640
Though I can't quite put my finger on it.

297
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:53,559
Just as you said, Captain Lu,

298
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:55,799
in this recording of his,

299
00:17:55,799 --> 00:17:57,720
the only one he omitted is Chen Hai.

300
00:17:58,359 --> 00:17:59,720
Yet precisely because he was omitted,

301
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:00,799
I feel that Chen Hai

302
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,359
might actually be the one

303
00:18:02,359 --> 00:18:03,640
who stands to gain the most.

304
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:06,839
But the evidence is right in front of us.

305
00:18:07,079 --> 00:18:08,359
We can't let speculation

306
00:18:08,599 --> 00:18:09,519
drive our investigation.

307
00:18:10,119 --> 00:18:11,599
Unless new evidence overturns it,

308
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,880
we will provisionally conclude

309
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:19,359
that Zhou Fuhai ran the Zhongtian ring.

310
00:18:27,759 --> 00:18:28,599
So what do we do now?

311
00:18:29,559 --> 00:18:30,279
Let Chen Hai go?

312
00:18:31,279 --> 00:18:31,920
We don't.

313
00:18:35,359 --> 00:18:36,279
This recording

314
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:40,400
only clears his ties to Zhongtian.

315
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:42,119
It doesn't prove

316
00:18:42,319 --> 00:18:44,240
whether he's tied to Four-Legged Snake,

317
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:46,119
Li Qiang, and Hu Dong.

318
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,759
Then we hold him for 48 hours.

319
00:18:51,119 --> 00:18:52,559
And within these 48 hours,

320
00:18:52,559 --> 00:18:53,759
we have three things to do.

321
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:56,119
First, find Hu Dong.

322
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:59,119
Second, confirm that Chen Hai and Hu Dong

323
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,079
have a direct connection.

324
00:19:00,359 --> 00:19:01,039
Third,

325
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,400
confirm that Hu Dong

326
00:19:02,559 --> 00:19:04,599
is the killer in the Dongshan Park murder.

327
00:19:06,559 --> 00:19:07,359
Contact Forensics.

328
00:19:07,359 --> 00:19:08,559
Have them rush

329
00:19:09,079 --> 00:19:10,319
the Dongshan Park murder case's

330
00:19:10,319 --> 00:19:11,200
DNA report,

331
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:13,559
and compare it against Longze Group's

332
00:19:14,119 --> 00:19:15,400
security team's DNA profiles.

333
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:17,319
Got it. I'll have them rush the results.

334
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:22,960
Captain Shen.

335
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,559
Right. Understood.

336
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,759
Word just came from the hospital.

337
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:33,319
Of the suspects from yesterday noon,

338
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:35,680
two died while being resuscitated.

339
00:19:36,359 --> 00:19:37,759
Liang Wenbiao is still in a coma.

340
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,400
Mai Wendi had the lightest injuries

341
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:40,279
and has regained consciousness.

342
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:41,960
Li Xiao.

343
00:19:45,279 --> 00:19:46,400
Li Qiang is extremely vengeful.

344
00:19:46,599 --> 00:19:48,160
Liang Wenbiao teamed up with others

345
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:49,079
to kill him this time.

346
00:19:49,559 --> 00:19:50,920
He will definitely seek revenge.

347
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,160
Guan Qiang.

348
00:19:52,279 --> 00:19:53,359
Go take the statement with Li Xiao.

349
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:55,559
And remind the criminal squad officers

350
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:57,839
to keep the suspects protected at all times.

351
00:19:58,319 --> 00:19:58,680
Yes, sir.

352
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:06,480
Captain Bai.

353
00:20:07,599 --> 00:20:08,720
I know what you're worried about.

354
00:20:09,279 --> 00:20:10,880
But we have to trust our colleagues.

355
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:11,880
He can handle it.

356
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:18,839
Those fugitives

357
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:21,200
are extremely dangerous individuals.

358
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:23,720
They are very likely to come back

359
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:24,839
to rescue their accomplices,

360
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:27,640
or even silence them.

361
00:20:28,559 --> 00:20:30,400
So you must stay on high alert.

362
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:32,519
Yes, understood.

363
00:20:34,799 --> 00:20:35,119
Captain Shen.

364
00:20:37,799 --> 00:20:38,640
How is the suspect?

365
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:41,279
Mai Wendi is awake,

366
00:20:41,839 --> 00:20:43,119
but the doctor did mention

367
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:44,880
he can't take any stress right now.

368
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:47,720
Go ahead in.

369
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:23,079
Ma Jingrong and you brothers,

370
00:21:23,559 --> 00:21:24,759
along with Chen Hai from Longze Group,

371
00:21:24,759 --> 00:21:27,039
established a drug network in Nanhai.

372
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:30,839
Ma Jingrong brought in downstream dealers,

373
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:34,119
while Chen Hai collected the drug money

374
00:21:34,119 --> 00:21:34,920
and laundered it illegally.

375
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:37,599
But once Qin Hao and Wu Liang

376
00:21:37,599 --> 00:21:39,160
were arrested by our police,

377
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:42,599
you lost your foothold in Nanhai.

378
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:45,599
The syndicate behind you even

379
00:21:46,079 --> 00:21:47,440
brought in Four-Legged Snake's crew

380
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,680
to wipe you all out.

381
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:49,400
Even after that,

382
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,640
do you still want to keep their secrets?

383
00:21:52,319 --> 00:21:53,559
Nothing you say will change anything.

384
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:55,759
I'll never help you cops.

385
00:21:56,039 --> 00:21:56,880
If it weren't for us cops,

386
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:58,039
you would already be dead.

387
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,799
Keeping me alive a few extra days

388
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,680
is just so I'll rat out my brothers.

389
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:04,599
We saved you

390
00:22:04,599 --> 00:22:05,759
so that more people could live.

391
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:07,720
All the drugs you pushed over the years...

392
00:22:07,839 --> 00:22:08,759
Do you know how many lives they destroyed?

393
00:22:09,519 --> 00:22:10,799
Don't you feel any guilt at all?

394
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:14,039
Fine.

395
00:22:17,079 --> 00:22:17,440
Fine.

396
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:19,680
Let's talk about your brothers.

397
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:20,680
That Li Qiang.

398
00:22:21,759 --> 00:22:22,920
Don't you know what kind of man he is?

399
00:22:25,160 --> 00:22:26,119
If he really saw you as a brother,

400
00:22:26,119 --> 00:22:27,440
would he just watch you get arrested?

401
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:31,559
Let me tell you.

402
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:34,519
He doesn't care about loyalty at all,

403
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:35,359
only hatred.

404
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:40,559
Wasn't Wu Liang your brother, too?

405
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:44,440
After Wu Liang went down,

406
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:47,240
didn't Ma Jingrong immediately

407
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:48,200
send people to kill him?

408
00:22:52,359 --> 00:22:54,799
This brotherhood you hold so dear,

409
00:22:55,359 --> 00:22:56,480
in a moment of crisis,

410
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:58,400
won't just fail to save you,

411
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:01,000
it'll drag you straight into the abyss.

412
00:23:12,839 --> 00:23:14,000
Your boss, Ma Jingrong,

413
00:23:15,119 --> 00:23:17,039
has been arrested by Country M's police.

414
00:23:18,119 --> 00:23:19,240
Your brother, Xiao Yunfei,

415
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,960
was also shot dead by the police.

416
00:23:23,039 --> 00:23:25,599
Whether it's you or Li Qiang,

417
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:28,720
you've both reached the end of the line.

418
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:41,839
In whatever time you have left,

419
00:23:42,359 --> 00:23:44,319
why don't you think about your family?

420
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:46,880
I don't have a family.

421
00:23:47,640 --> 00:23:48,000
No.

422
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:50,720
You have a mother.

423
00:23:51,039 --> 00:23:52,240
My mom's long dead.

424
00:23:53,279 --> 00:23:54,200
When you were eight,

425
00:23:55,519 --> 00:23:56,440
your father passed away,

426
00:23:57,279 --> 00:23:58,599
your mother ran away from home,

427
00:24:00,759 --> 00:24:02,279
and your grandmother raised you.

428
00:24:02,599 --> 00:24:04,119
You've never seen her since.

429
00:24:04,599 --> 00:24:05,759
But let me tell you,

430
00:24:06,839 --> 00:24:08,000
we've already found

431
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:09,160
where your mother is.

432
00:24:09,559 --> 00:24:11,160
Don't you want to see her again,

433
00:24:12,599 --> 00:24:13,839
to ask her to her face

434
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:17,920
why she abandoned you back then?

435
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:45,319
Hold on.

436
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:52,720
The unfinished building in Xinqiao.

437
00:25:49,039 --> 00:25:49,440
Search.

438
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:37,200
Li Xiao!

439
00:26:58,599 --> 00:26:59,160
Stay back!

440
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:05,359
I've stepped on a bomb!

441
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:22,720
Quick, call the bomb squad!

442
00:27:22,799 --> 00:27:23,240
Yes, sir!

443
00:27:36,759 --> 00:27:37,400
Where are you taking me?

444
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:38,960
Away from here.

445
00:27:41,519 --> 00:27:42,000
Away?

446
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:46,319
I'm not going with you.

447
00:27:47,359 --> 00:27:48,079
Let me go!

448
00:27:51,880 --> 00:27:52,920
I told you to stop the car!

449
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:03,599
If you want to leave,

450
00:28:04,799 --> 00:28:05,440
go right ahead.

451
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:13,960
But let me remind you,

452
00:28:14,039 --> 00:28:15,079
what I can't have,

453
00:28:15,079 --> 00:28:16,240
no one else gets either.

454
00:28:18,039 --> 00:28:19,000
The moment you step out of this car,

455
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:21,079
I guarantee you

456
00:28:21,079 --> 00:28:23,440
you'll never see your cop boyfriend again.

457
00:28:35,759 --> 00:28:36,519
What are you doing?

458
00:28:41,359 --> 00:28:42,400
Why are you doing this?

459
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,759
Why are you doing this to us?

460
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:47,200
Because he owes my brother a life.

461
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,599
I let him off easy by not killing him.

462
00:28:53,039 --> 00:28:53,839
In this world,

463
00:28:53,839 --> 00:28:56,079
everything comes at a price.

464
00:28:56,880 --> 00:28:58,720
I won't just watch the woman I love

465
00:28:58,720 --> 00:29:00,000
go back to him

466
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:02,480
and live happily with him.

467
00:29:02,839 --> 00:29:04,119
You asked me earlier

468
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:08,160
if I kidnapped you out of jealousy.

469
00:29:11,799 --> 00:29:13,559
I thought about it,

470
00:29:15,279 --> 00:29:16,160
and you were right.

471
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,599
He made me lose everything,

472
00:29:20,880 --> 00:29:22,480
and I took his woman.

473
00:29:24,079 --> 00:29:25,359
It's only fair.

474
00:30:42,759 --> 00:30:43,359
Under the bed.

475
00:30:50,079 --> 00:30:51,680
Captain Lu, get the men out first.

476
00:30:52,799 --> 00:30:53,680
You guys pull out first.

477
00:30:54,279 --> 00:30:54,960
I'll stay with him.

478
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:55,680
Yes, sir.

479
00:30:56,359 --> 00:30:56,920
Captain Lu...

480
00:30:58,039 --> 00:30:58,839
You evacuate first.

481
00:31:01,279 --> 00:31:01,839
Don't worry.

482
00:31:06,079 --> 00:31:06,440
All right.

483
00:31:08,559 --> 00:31:09,200
I'll be waiting for you.

484
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:39,240
Lift the bed.

485
00:31:51,599 --> 00:31:53,039
This is an encrypted touch-sensitive bomb.

486
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:55,519
The first touch triggered the timer.

487
00:31:55,839 --> 00:31:57,559
Touching it again will detonate it.

488
00:31:58,039 --> 00:31:58,920
So right now,

489
00:31:59,599 --> 00:32:00,559
you must not move at all.

490
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:02,880
Even slightly moving a toe

491
00:32:02,920 --> 00:32:03,920
will detonate the bomb.

492
00:32:06,799 --> 00:32:08,720
There's less than five minutes left.

493
00:32:09,160 --> 00:32:10,839
We must crack the code immediately.

494
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:12,480
How long will it take to crack the code?

495
00:32:12,960 --> 00:32:13,640
Three minutes.

496
00:32:14,319 --> 00:32:15,279
But I'm not sure.

497
00:32:15,799 --> 00:32:17,000
Quick, sandbag barrier!

498
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,799
Hold on. You're going to be okay.

499
00:33:24,480 --> 00:33:25,319
Just let me go.

500
00:33:26,799 --> 00:33:28,039
I won't see him again.

501
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:29,759
I swear.

502
00:33:32,240 --> 00:33:33,559
I'll never see him again.

503
00:33:35,119 --> 00:33:36,160
If you just let me go.

504
00:33:37,640 --> 00:33:38,559
I'm begging you.

505
00:33:39,880 --> 00:33:41,559
Please, just let me go, okay?

506
00:33:41,960 --> 00:33:43,720
I made it very clear before.

507
00:33:44,799 --> 00:33:46,240
If you leave me,

508
00:33:46,960 --> 00:33:49,000
you'll never see him again in this life.

509
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:51,039
Then what's the difference

510
00:33:51,039 --> 00:33:51,960
between what you said and what I said?

511
00:33:51,960 --> 00:33:53,680
Why?

512
00:33:58,200 --> 00:33:58,960
Why?

513
00:33:59,799 --> 00:34:01,079
Why take what happened to you

514
00:34:01,079 --> 00:34:02,440
and inflict it on us?

515
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:03,759
I'm a drug dealer.

516
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:05,279
He's a cop.

517
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:07,440
We're destined to be mortal enemies.

518
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:09,440
I'll give you one minute.

519
00:34:10,719 --> 00:34:12,400
Think it over carefully.

520
00:34:13,519 --> 00:34:14,320
Do you want to leave or not?

521
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:01,199
The timer is paused for now,

522
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:03,920
but the trigger mechanism is underneath.

523
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:05,639
I'm not sure if disabling the trigger

524
00:35:05,639 --> 00:35:07,559
will restart the timer.

525
00:35:08,159 --> 00:35:09,440
Now, I'll count down from three.

526
00:35:09,679 --> 00:35:10,559
On the last count,

527
00:35:10,800 --> 00:35:11,760
start running out.

528
00:35:31,480 --> 00:35:31,960
Three.

529
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:33,199
Two.

530
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:35,639
One.

531
00:35:38,840 --> 00:35:39,800
Run!

532
00:35:53,880 --> 00:35:54,719
Help him, hurry!

533
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:04,000
Li Xiao!

534
00:36:08,199 --> 00:36:09,679
Li Xiao, wake up! Li Xiao!

535
00:36:10,079 --> 00:36:10,599
Li Xiao!

536
00:36:11,519 --> 00:36:12,039
Li Xiao!

537
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:17,480
Li Xiao, can you hear me?

538
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:22,159
Li Qiang is still on the run.

539
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,039
Find him.

540
00:36:25,440 --> 00:36:26,360
Find Tian Xin.

541
00:36:29,159 --> 00:36:29,679
Li Xiao!

542
00:36:32,079 --> 00:36:32,519
Li Xiao!

543
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:34,360
Li Xiao!

544
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:36,519
Li Xiao!

545
00:36:51,519 --> 00:36:52,559
If I go with you,

546
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:55,800
will you let him go?

547
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:26,480
Come on out.

548
00:38:06,239 --> 00:38:08,199
I spent a fortune

549
00:38:09,199 --> 00:38:11,119
to finally get you and that Ma guy

550
00:38:11,119 --> 00:38:12,440
out of that place.

551
00:38:12,719 --> 00:38:14,800
Aren't you going to reimburse me

552
00:38:16,039 --> 00:38:16,480
for this?

553
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,000
Don't think I don't know.

554
00:38:19,440 --> 00:38:20,400
Every cent you spent

555
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:23,039
will be reimbursed by Officer Mai.

556
00:38:24,199 --> 00:38:24,559
Come on.

557
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:27,159
I bailed you out.

558
00:38:27,519 --> 00:38:29,440
Shouldn't you show some gratitude?

559
00:38:31,480 --> 00:38:32,400
If you want money,

560
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:35,000
ask him—Ma Jingrong.

561
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:36,000
He's got the cash.

562
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:39,800
By the way,

563
00:38:41,559 --> 00:38:43,119
were you doing that on purpose last time?

564
00:38:46,239 --> 00:38:48,920
When Kano was about to attack you,

565
00:38:49,199 --> 00:38:51,400
you pretended not to notice.

566
00:38:51,679 --> 00:38:52,920
Did you already anticipate

567
00:38:53,079 --> 00:38:55,440
that Ma Jingrong would step in to help?

568
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:56,639
He saved me,

569
00:38:57,159 --> 00:38:58,599
so I became devoted to him.

570
00:38:59,239 --> 00:39:00,440
It's only natural.

571
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:03,440
I was wondering about that.

572
00:39:03,559 --> 00:39:05,960
Turns out you had it planned all along.

573
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:09,440
What was that phrase you mentioned before?

574
00:39:10,280 --> 00:39:12,400
Playing...

575
00:39:12,599 --> 00:39:13,679
Playing hard to get.

576
00:39:14,280 --> 00:39:16,199
Right, playing hard to get.

577
00:39:18,840 --> 00:39:19,480
Big Brother is here.

578
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:45,840
How are you? Feeling any better?

579
00:39:47,280 --> 00:39:48,960
Almost died.

580
00:39:50,599 --> 00:39:51,599
If you stay in here,

581
00:39:51,760 --> 00:39:52,800
you're gonna die sooner or later.

582
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:53,880
Well...

583
00:39:56,159 --> 00:39:57,800
you don't really expect us

584
00:39:58,159 --> 00:39:59,480
to break out with you, do you?

585
00:40:02,280 --> 00:40:02,800
Why?

586
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,440
Don't tell me the two of you

587
00:40:04,440 --> 00:40:06,000
actually want to stay in this hellhole?

588
00:40:08,239 --> 00:40:10,400
If you're innocent in the relic heist,

589
00:40:10,599 --> 00:40:12,960
the Hirano police will let you go eventually.

590
00:40:13,559 --> 00:40:14,960
But if you stir up trouble like this

591
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:15,519
and try to break out,

592
00:40:16,320 --> 00:40:17,599
it's a dead end.

593
00:40:18,159 --> 00:40:19,079
I can't imagine

594
00:40:19,079 --> 00:40:20,920
what your reason is for doing this.

595
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:23,159
Truth be told,

596
00:40:23,519 --> 00:40:24,760
I made a deal

597
00:40:25,679 --> 00:40:27,119
with a certain man.

598
00:40:27,840 --> 00:40:29,480
If I break that deal,

599
00:40:30,559 --> 00:40:32,320
I'll never see my wife again.

600
00:40:33,559 --> 00:40:34,360
Boss Ma,

601
00:40:35,440 --> 00:40:37,599
you're Chinese.

602
00:40:38,599 --> 00:40:42,280
Who would you make a deal with in Country M?

603
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:49,280
I move goods between China and Country M.

604
00:40:50,840 --> 00:40:52,960
I took in a shipment

605
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:54,599
from a guy named Jiang Liye.

606
00:40:56,119 --> 00:40:57,280
And this Jiang Liye,

607
00:40:58,400 --> 00:40:59,320
fearing I'd back out,

608
00:40:59,480 --> 00:41:02,079
held my wife hostage to keep me in check.

609
00:41:02,559 --> 00:41:03,199
In the end,

610
00:41:04,119 --> 00:41:06,199
I got caught before offloading the goods.

611
00:41:07,719 --> 00:41:08,360
So,

612
00:41:09,039 --> 00:41:10,880
if I don't get out of here soon,

613
00:41:13,880 --> 00:41:16,039
I really will never see my wife again.

614
00:41:18,119 --> 00:41:19,480
Jiang Liye...

615
00:41:21,960 --> 00:41:23,440
Boss Ma, last time you told me

616
00:41:23,679 --> 00:41:25,519
to contact someone on the outside.

617
00:41:25,679 --> 00:41:26,280
Right.

618
00:41:26,719 --> 00:41:28,480
I was hoping your guy

619
00:41:28,480 --> 00:41:29,840
could get word to Jiang Liye.

620
00:41:30,079 --> 00:41:31,360
If I get out of here,

621
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:33,960
I'll pay him back as fast as I can.

622
00:41:34,039 --> 00:41:35,519
If I die in here,

623
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:37,480
he won't get a damn thing.

624
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:40,199
No, but wait...

625
00:41:41,639 --> 00:41:43,079
You said some of your money

626
00:41:43,079 --> 00:41:44,519
is with your wife.

627
00:41:45,079 --> 00:41:47,159
Then Jiang Liye could just

628
00:41:47,559 --> 00:41:48,920
take the money straight from her.

629
00:41:51,239 --> 00:41:52,360
In this world,

630
00:41:53,639 --> 00:41:56,719
no one can force my wife

631
00:41:56,719 --> 00:41:58,320
to do anything she doesn't want to.

632
00:42:04,039 --> 00:42:04,559
So,

633
00:42:06,159 --> 00:42:06,920
have you decided?

634
00:42:08,719 --> 00:42:10,039
Do you want to come with me

635
00:42:11,440 --> 00:42:13,360
and live the high life?

636
00:42:14,719 --> 00:42:15,840
You saved my life.

637
00:42:16,559 --> 00:42:17,639
I should stand by you.

638
00:42:22,119 --> 00:42:23,440
If my brother's in,

639
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:24,920
count me in too.

640
00:42:24,960 --> 00:42:25,960
Only...

641
00:42:27,320 --> 00:42:29,159
if it's not too much trouble,

642
00:42:29,360 --> 00:42:32,559
a little extra incentive

643
00:42:33,199 --> 00:42:34,920
would make it even sweeter.

644
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:36,159
At the very least,

645
00:42:37,079 --> 00:42:38,599
whenever you want some,

646
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:40,320
you won't be out of supply.

647
00:42:46,960 --> 00:42:47,880
Since we're leaving,

648
00:42:48,079 --> 00:42:49,239
let's get a plan together fast.

649
00:42:57,480 --> 00:42:59,760
Tony had someone smuggle word out of prison.

650
00:43:01,039 --> 00:43:03,000
Zhuang Yan has gained Ma Jingrong's trust.

651
00:43:04,119 --> 00:43:05,360
Ma Jingrong took the initiative

652
00:43:05,880 --> 00:43:07,000
to break out together with Zhuang Yan.

653
00:43:09,480 --> 00:43:10,880
So what do we need to do now?

654
00:43:12,880 --> 00:43:13,880
A prison break...

655
00:43:14,119 --> 00:43:16,519
That needs approval from Country M police.

656
00:43:19,880 --> 00:43:22,239
Then we'll play it for real.
